{"id":"8f42189e0d182d7e","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/636_命题时序逻辑_PTL.md","title":"636 命题时序逻辑 PTL","display":"636_命题时序逻辑_PTL","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。原始构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom},\\quad\\bot,\\quad\\operatorname{neg},\\quad\\operatorname{imp},\\quad\\operatorname{next},\\quad\\operatorname{always},\\quad\\operatorname{previous},\\quad\\operatorname{historical}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom},\\quad\\bot,\\quad\\operatorname{neg},\\quad\\operatorname{imp},\\quad\\operatorname{next},\\quad\\operatorname{always},\\quad\\operatorname{previous},\\quad\\operatorname{historical}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"XA,GA,YA,HA\">\\(XA,GA,YA,HA\\)</span>。派生记号为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B=\\neg A\\to B,\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A),\\quad\nFA=\\neg G\\neg A,\\quad\nPA=\\neg H\\neg A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B=\\neg A\\to B,\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A),\\quad\nFA=\\neg G\\neg A,\\quad\nPA=\\neg H\\neg A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定构造子。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"XA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\">\\(XA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"GA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\">\\(GA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"YA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\">\\(YA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"HA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\">\\(HA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元\">3. 自由变元</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{636}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{636}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{636}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{636}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{636}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{636}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{636}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{636}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{636}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{636}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{636}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{636}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{636}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{636}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{636}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{636}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{636}(XA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{636}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{636}(GA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{636}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{636}(XA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{636}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{636}(GA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{636}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{636}(YA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{636}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{636}(HA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{636}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{636}(YA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{636}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{636}(HA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{636}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{636}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{636}(A)=\\varnothing\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{636}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{636}(A)=\\varnothing\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\)</span> 成立。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-命题替换\">4. 命题替换</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{636}\">\\(\\mathsf{Subst}_{636}\\)</span> 为所有有限支撑函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\">\\(\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\)</span> 的集合，其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{supp}_{636}(\\sigma)=\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{supp}_{636}(\\sigma)=\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>是有限集。每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{636}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{636}\\)</span> 唯一扩张为类型化函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_{636}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma_{636}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_{636}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{636}(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{636}(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma_{636}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma_{636}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{636}(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{636}(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma_{636}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_{636}(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma_{636}(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma_{636}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma_{636}(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma_{636}(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma_{636}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_{636}(XA)=X\\widehat\\sigma_{636}(A),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{636}(GA)=G\\widehat\\sigma_{636}(A),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{636}(YA)=Y\\widehat\\sigma_{636}(A),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{636}(HA)=H\\widehat\\sigma_{636}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma_{636}(XA)=X\\widehat\\sigma_{636}(A),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{636}(GA)=G\\widehat\\sigma_{636}(A),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{636}(YA)=Y\\widehat\\sigma_{636}(A),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{636}(HA)=H\\widehat\\sigma_{636}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_{\\alpha,636}B\">\\(A\\equiv_{\\alpha,636}B\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=B\">\\(A=B\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-公理集合\">5. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>命题公理三族为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{636}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{636}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{636}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{636}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{636}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{636}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>时序公理族为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{XK}^{636}=\\{X(A\\to B)\\to(XA\\to XB):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{XK}^{636}=\\{X(A\\to B)\\to(XA\\to XB):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{GK}^{636}=\\{G(A\\to B)\\to(GA\\to GB):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{GK}^{636}=\\{G(A\\to B)\\to(GA\\to GB):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{YK}^{636}=\\{Y(A\\to B)\\to(YA\\to YB):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{YK}^{636}=\\{Y(A\\to B)\\to(YA\\to YB):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{HK}^{636}=\\{H(A\\to B)\\to(HA\\to HB):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{HK}^{636}=\\{H(A\\to B)\\to(HA\\to HB):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{GFix}^{636}=\\{GA\\to(A\\land XGA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{GFix}^{636}=\\{GA\\to(A\\land XGA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{HFix}^{636}=\\{HA\\to(A\\land YHA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{HFix}^{636}=\\{HA\\to(A\\land YHA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{636}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{636}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{636}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{636}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{XK}^{636}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{GK}^{636}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{YK}^{636}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{HK}^{636}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{GFix}^{636}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{HFix}^{636}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{636}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{636}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{636}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{636}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{XK}^{636}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{GK}^{636}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{YK}^{636}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{HK}^{636}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{GFix}^{636}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{HFix}^{636}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-推理规则关系\">6. 推理规则关系</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{636}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{636}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecX}^{636}=\\{((A),XA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecX}^{636}=\\{((A),XA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecG}^{636}=\\{((A),GA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecG}^{636}=\\{((A),GA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecY}^{636}=\\{((A),YA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecY}^{636}=\\{((A),YA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecH}^{636}=\\{((A),HA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecH}^{636}=\\{((A),HA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>四个一元模态规则分别具有类型</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecO}^{636}\\subseteq\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}^{\\,1}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\n\\qquad(O\\in\\{X,G,Y,H\\}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecO}^{636}\\subseteq\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}^{\\,1}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\n\\qquad(O\\in\\{X,G,Y,H\\}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecX}^{636},\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecG}^{636},\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecY}^{636},\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecH}^{636}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecX}^{636},\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecG}^{636},\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecY}^{636},\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecH}^{636}\\)</span> 正是上式的四个实例。</p>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{636}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{636}\\)</span> 为五者并，作为类型化关系</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{636}\\subseteq\n\\bigl(\\mathsf{Seq}_{&lt;\\omega}(\\mathsf{Frm}_{636})\\bigr)\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{636}\\subseteq\n\\bigl(\\mathsf{Seq}_{&lt;\\omega}(\\mathsf{Frm}_{636})\\bigr)\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Line}_{636}=\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm}_{636})\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{636},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Line}_{636}=\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm}_{636})\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{636},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{636}:\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm}_{636})\n\\longrightarrow\n\\mathcal P\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{m&gt;0}\\mathsf{Line}_{636}^{\\,m}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Proof}_{636}:\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm}_{636})\n\\longrightarrow\n\\mathcal P\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{m&gt;0}\\mathsf{Line}_{636}^{\\,m}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\)</span>。证明是非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Line}_{636}^{\\,m}\">\\(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Line}_{636}^{\\,m}\\)</span>。每行满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{636}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{636}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{636}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{636}\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecX}^{636}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecX}^{636}\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecG}^{636}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecG}^{636}\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecY}^{636}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecY}^{636}\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecH}^{636}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecH}^{636}\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{636}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{636}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 为所有满足上述条件的非空有限序列的集合。</p>\n<h1 id=\"8.-可证性\">8. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{636}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{636}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在证明行 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Delta_i,A)\">\\((\\Delta_i,A)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\subseteq\\Gamma\">\\(\\Delta_i\\subseteq\\Gamma\\)</span>。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{636}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{636}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{636}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{636}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>PTL 在本文件中以四个一元时序模态 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,G,Y,H\">\\(X,G,Y,H\\)</span> 为原始构造子，而不是使用 until/since 或路径量词。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-双向时间结构\">10. 双向时间结构</h1>\n<p>定义 PTL 迹集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Trace}_{636}\n=\n\\{\\nu:\\mathbb Z\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Trace}_{636}\n=\n\\{\\nu:\\mathbb Z\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义未来和过去可达关系：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FReach}_{636}(i,j)\\Longleftrightarrow i\\le j,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{PReach}_{636}(i,j)\\Longleftrightarrow j\\le i.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FReach}_{636}(i,j)\\Longleftrightarrow i\\le j,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{PReach}_{636}(i,j)\\Longleftrightarrow j\\le i.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"11.-满足关系\">11. 满足关系</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Vdash_{636}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Trace}_{636}\\times\\mathbb Z\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Vdash_{636}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Trace}_{636}\\times\\mathbb Z\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为满足下列递归子句的最小关系。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu,k\\Vdash_{636}\\operatorname{atom}(p)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\np\\in\\nu(k).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu,k\\Vdash_{636}\\operatorname{atom}(p)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\np\\in\\nu(k).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu,k\\not\\Vdash_{636}\\bot.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu,k\\not\\Vdash_{636}\\bot.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu,k\\Vdash_{636}\\neg A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\nu,k\\not\\Vdash_{636}A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu,k\\Vdash_{636}\\neg A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\nu,k\\not\\Vdash_{636}A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu,k\\Vdash_{636}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\nu,k\\not\\Vdash_{636}A\\ \\text{或}\\ \\nu,k\\Vdash_{636}B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu,k\\Vdash_{636}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\nu,k\\not\\Vdash_{636}A\\ \\text{或}\\ \\nu,k\\Vdash_{636}B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu,k\\Vdash_{636}XA\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\nu,k+1\\Vdash_{636}A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu,k\\Vdash_{636}XA\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\nu,k+1\\Vdash_{636}A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu,k\\Vdash_{636}YA\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\nu,k-1\\Vdash_{636}A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu,k\\Vdash_{636}YA\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\nu,k-1\\Vdash_{636}A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu,k\\Vdash_{636}GA\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall j\\in\\mathbb Z\\,(k\\le j\\to\\nu,j\\Vdash_{636}A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu,k\\Vdash_{636}GA\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall j\\in\\mathbb Z\\,(k\\le j\\to\\nu,j\\Vdash_{636}A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu,k\\Vdash_{636}HA\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall j\\in\\mathbb Z\\,(j\\le k\\to\\nu,j\\Vdash_{636}A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu,k\\Vdash_{636}HA\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall j\\in\\mathbb Z\\,(j\\le k\\to\\nu,j\\Vdash_{636}A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"12.-语义后果\">12. 语义后果</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}\\)</span>，定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{636}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{636}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\\in\\mathsf{Trace}_{636}\">\\(\\nu\\in\\mathsf{Trace}_{636}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb Z\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb Z\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ \\nu,k\\Vdash_{636}B\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\nu,k\\Vdash_{636}A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ \\nu,k\\Vdash_{636}B\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\nu,k\\Vdash_{636}A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Val}_{636}\n=\n\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}:\\varnothing\\models_{636}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Val}_{636}\n=\n\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}:\\varnothing\\models_{636}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"13.-整个形式系统\">13. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{PTL}_{636}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{636},\\operatorname{FV}_{636},\\operatorname{BV}_{636},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{636},\\widehat\\sigma_{636},\\equiv_{\\alpha,636},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{636},\\mathsf{Rule}_{636},\\mathsf{Line}_{636},\\mathsf{Proof}_{636},\\vdash_{636},\\mathsf{Thm}_{636},\n\\mathsf{Trace}_{636},\\operatorname{FReach}_{636},\\operatorname{PReach}_{636},\n\\Vdash_{636},\\models_{636},\\mathsf{Val}_{636}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{PTL}_{636}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{636},\\operatorname{FV}_{636},\\operatorname{BV}_{636},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{636},\\widehat\\sigma_{636},\\equiv_{\\alpha,636},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{636},\\mathsf{Rule}_{636},\\mathsf{Line}_{636},\\mathsf{Proof}_{636},\\vdash_{636},\\mathsf{Thm}_{636},\n\\mathsf{Trace}_{636},\\operatorname{FReach}_{636},\\operatorname{PReach}_{636},\n\\Vdash_{636},\\models_{636},\\mathsf{Val}_{636}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统含四个一元时序模态的双向离散时间语义；不含 until/since 构造、自动机翻译或完备性证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元","text":"3. 自由变元","level":1},{"id":"4.-命题替换","text":"4. 命题替换","level":1},{"id":"5.-公理集合","text":"5. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"6.-推理规则关系","text":"6. 推理规则关系","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明对象","text":"7. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"8.-可证性","text":"8. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标区分","text":"9. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"10.-双向时间结构","text":"10. 双向时间结构","level":1},{"id":"11.-满足关系","text":"11. 满足关系","level":1},{"id":"12.-语义后果","text":"12. 语义后果","level":1},{"id":"13.-整个形式系统","text":"13. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom},\\quad\\bot,\\quad\\operatorname{neg},\\quad\\operatorname{imp},\\quad\\operatorname{next},\\quad\\operatorname{always},\\quad\\operatorname{previous},\\quad\\operatorname{historical}.","display":true},{"tex":"XA,GA,YA,HA","display":false},{"tex":"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B=\\neg A\\to B,\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A),\\quad\nFA=\\neg G\\neg A,\\quad\nPA=\\neg H\\neg A.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}","display":false},{"tex":"XA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}","display":false},{"tex":"GA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}","display":false},{"tex":"YA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}","display":false},{"tex":"HA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{636}